        "language": "english",
        "review": "After reading the developer's website, I realized this was made by an original developer of Star Stable and Starshine legacy whose credits were completely removed from SSO despite CREATING THE ENTIRE ENGINE (which they STILL USE!!!) HIMSELF. Anders Åkerfeldt is his name, and going through the wayback machine's archive of Pixel Tales, you can even see his name first in the credits. Shame on SSE for removing his credits anywhere they could.\n\nMy joy is immense, and I myself consider this game a giant \"F*** YOU\" to modern SSO/ Star Stable Entertainment (even if not intended to be), and 100% a love letter to the original developers from 2006-2014. \n\nAbsolute beauty of a game, so nostalgic and pretty. Proof you dont need \"modern graphics\" or over-stylized graphics to make a nice game. (im talking to you SSE...)",
